{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16730","headline":"宿西山修下元斋咏 · 于鹄","name":"宿西山修下元斋咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽人在何处，松桧深冥冥。\n西峰望紫云，知处安期生。\n沐浴溪水暖，新衣礼仙名。\n脱屐入静堂，遶像随礼行。\n碧纱笼寒灯，长幡缀金铃。\n林下听法人，起坐枯叶声。\n啓奏修律仪，天曙山鸟鸣。\n分行布菅茅，列坐满中庭。\n持斋候撞钟，玉函散宝经。\n焚香开卷时，照耀金室明。\n投简石洞深，称过上帝灵。\n学道能苦心，自古无不成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}